'=>'已导入 %d 个设置。密码和 API 密钥不会包含在导出文件中，请重新输入。','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有些问题需要处理','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'在您自己的账户上运行','We could not check this'=>'无法完成此检查','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'此插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'最后检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'（在新标签页中打开）','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'发送至 Zinn® 支持团队','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'这正是将要发送的内容——没有别的，也没有隐藏内容。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在其中。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将要发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送给 Zinn® 支持人员','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们为您创建一个支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不想发送，请复制上述内容并自行将其粘贴到工单中。','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'无法从该服务器 (%s) 连接到 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单 —— 您的设置没有任何问题。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® 客服已收到您的报告（参考编号：%s），并将通过电子邮件回复您。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多个报告。请稍候几分钟再试——先前的报告已经送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接受该报告——这是我们这边的问题，而非您的。请稍后重试，或将上面的报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报告被拒绝（HTTP %d）。请将其复制到上方并提交工单，附上该编号。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读%s用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® WordPress 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及为管理多个网站的人群打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖已建成的网站、域名和链接外链，资金将妥善保管，直到双方满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的人为您代劳','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业者市场：浏览来自作家、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家的 10,000 多项现成服务，或者发布项目并让他们竞标。','Style preset'=>'样式预设','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'一个起点。其下的任何内容都会覆盖它。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'不勾选此项，预设将完全按原样使用。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'请参阅 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® 更新服务未为此更新发出下载链接。请检查此站点是否可以连接到 Zinn® 平台，然后重试。','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'无法从 Zinn® 更新服务 (%s) 下载更新。请几分钟后重试。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'已下载的更新未能通过完整性检查，因此未进行安装。','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'无法完成该操作。请重试，如果仍未成功，请联系网站管理员。','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'缺少必填值或格式错误。请检查该功能的数据输入模式。','The site refused the request.'=>'网站拒绝了该请求。','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'让诸如 Claude、Cursor 或 VS Code 等 AI 助手通过 MCP（模型上下文协议）为您在此网站上工作。它们将使用应用程序密码以 WordPress 用户身份登录，并且只能执行该用户被允许执行的操作。','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'AI 代理需要 WordPress 6.9 或更高版本。请更新 WordPress 以使用它们。','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'连接地址 (MCP 端点)','Create an application password for your user'=>'为您的用户创建应用程序密码','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'将其添加到您的 AI 应用的 MCP 设置中，并填入您的用户名和该密码：','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code：请在 .vscode/mcp.json 中的 "servers" 下添加相同的条目，而不是在 "mcpServers" 下。','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'此处AI代理可使用的工具 (%d)：','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'用户指南：AI 智能体与 MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'开发者文档：功能、REST 与 MCP','Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site.'=>'在此网站上管理您在 Zinn Digital® 上的托管客户、他们的套餐及其网站。','Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account.'=>'通过您的 Zinn Digital® 分销商账户，管理您的客户、他们的套餐及其网站。','Read your reseller account'=>'阅读您的分销商账户','Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up.'=>'一次性获取您的代理商账户概览：品牌、套餐、客户数、服务数以及当前配置。','List your clients'=>'列出您的客户','Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit).'=>'列出您的客户账户，每次显示一页（cursor，limit）。','Create a client'=>'创建客户','Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site.'=>'在您的账户下创建一个客户账户（名称；default_currency，三位字母代码）。在他们的第一个网站之前为他们选择一个套餐。','Read a client\'s plan'=>'查看客户的方案','Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id).'=>'返回客户当前的套餐及为您产生的费用 (client_id)。','Put a client on a plan'=>'为客户分配方案','Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site.'=>'将客户加入您的其中一个方案（client_id, plan_code; interval: month 或 year）。请在他们的第一个站点之前执行此操作。','List the plans you can sell'=>'列出您可以销售的套餐','Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it).'=>'列出托管方案及其价格（可通过 product_line 和 currency 进行筛选）。','List your clients\' sites'=>'列出您的客户网站','Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time.'=>'逐页列出您为客户配置的所有内容（可通过 client_id 和 status 进行筛选）。','Create a site for a client'=>'为客户创建站点','Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client\'s plan, as from your shop.'=>'为您的某个客户（client_id, product_line, primary_domain）创建一个托管站点。该站点将按照客户的套餐计费并记在您的账户下，就像由您的店铺创建的一样。','Suspend a client\'s site'=>'暂停客户网站','Puts a client\'s site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended.'=>'将客户端网站置于欠费暂停状态 (site_id；原因：您自己的备注，绝不会向客户端展示)。该网站将停止服务，直至解除暂停。','Unsuspend a client\'s site'=>'解除客户网站暂停状态','Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id).'=>'解除未付款锁定，使网站恢复访问 (site_id)。','Read the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'读取分销商工具包设置','Returns this plugin\'s settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'返回此插件的设置（API 地址、新订单使用的套餐、已启用的功能）。绝不返回 API 密钥，仅返回是否已保存密钥。','Change the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'更改分销商工具包设置','Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only.'=>'更改您发送的设置 (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) 并保留其余设置。API 密钥和地址仅在屏幕上更改。','Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first.'=>'请先在“代理商工具包”屏幕上添加您的 Zinn Digital® 代理商 API 密钥。']];